{"seq":10,"slug":"lc0376-wiggle-subsequence","title":"LeetCode 376 摆动序列","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-search-greedy/lc0376-wiggle-subsequence","wordCount":959,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"leetcode-376-摆动序列\">LeetCode 376 摆动序列</h1><h2 id=\"题目描述\">题目描述</h2><p>如果连续数字之间的差严格地在正数和负数之间交替，则数字序列称为摆动序列。第一个差（如果存在的话）可能是正数或负数。仅有一个元素或者含两个不等元素的序列也视作摆动序列。</p>\n<p>给你一个整数数组 <code>nums</code>，返回 <code>nums</code> 中作为摆动序列的最长子序列的长度。</p>\n<p>子序列可以通过从原始序列中删除一些（也可以不删除）元素来获得，剩下的元素保持其原始顺序。</p>\n<p><strong>约束条件：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1 ≤ nums.length ≤ 1000</li>\n<li>0 ≤ nums[i] ≤ 1000</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>示例 1：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [1,7,4,9,2,5] 输出：6解释：整个序列就是摆动序列，差值序列为 [6,-3,5,-7,3]，正负交替。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 2：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [1,17,5,10,13,15,10,5,16,8] 输出：7解释：一个可能的最长摆动子序列为 [1,17,5,15,5,16,8]，差值序列为 [16,-12,10,-10,11,-8]。</p>\n<p><strong>示例 3：</strong></p>\n<p>输入：nums = [1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9] 输出：2 解释：单调递增序列中最长摆动子序列长度为 2（任取相邻两个元素）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"解题思路\">解题思路</h2><p>本题可以用动态规划或贪心来解。贪心解法更加简洁高效，核心思想是<strong>统计序列中&quot;方向变化&quot;的次数</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>动态规划解法</strong>：定义两个状态 <code>up[i]</code> 和 <code>down[i]</code>，分别表示以位置 <code>i</code> 结尾、最后一步上升/下降的最长摆动序列长度。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[i] &gt; nums[i-1]</code>：<code>up[i] = down[i-1] + 1</code>，<code>down[i] = down[i-1]</code></li>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[i] &lt; nums[i-1]</code>：<code>down[i] = up[i-1] + 1</code>，<code>up[i] = up[i-1]</code></li>\n<li>如果 <code>nums[i] === nums[i-1]</code>：<code>up[i] = up[i-1]</code>，<code>down[i] = down[i-1]</code></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>贪心解法（最优解）</strong>：将数组想象为一条折线图。最长摆动子序列就是保留所有&quot;拐点&quot;（波峰和波谷）。对于连续上升或连续下降的段，只需要保留首尾两个点。因此只需统计方向变化的次数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n<th>空间复杂度</th>\n<th>核心思想</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>暴力枚举</td>\n<td>O(2ⁿ)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>枚举所有子序列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态规划</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>双状态转移（可优化为 O(1) 空间）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贪心</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>统计方向变化次数</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码实现\">代码实现</h2><p><strong>贪心解法：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function wiggleMaxLength(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  if (nums.length &lt; 2) return nums.length;&#10;&#10;  let prevDiff = 0;&#10;  let count = 1;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; nums.length; i++) {&#10;    const currDiff = nums[i] - nums[i - 1];&#10;&#10;    if ((currDiff &gt; 0 &amp;&amp; prevDiff &lt;= 0) || (currDiff &lt; 0 &amp;&amp; prevDiff &gt;= 0)) {&#10;      count++;&#10;      prevDiff = currDiff;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return count;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wiggleMaxLength</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevDiff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> currDiff</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ((currDiff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevDiff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">||</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (currDiff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevDiff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      prevDiff </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currDiff;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>代码逻辑详解：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>prevDiff</code>：记录上一次有效差值的方向（正/负/零）。初始为 0，表示还没有确定方向</li>\n<li><code>count</code>：摆动序列长度，初始为 1（至少包含第一个元素）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>遍历时计算当前差值 <code>currDiff</code>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>如果 <code>currDiff &gt; 0</code> 且 <code>prevDiff &lt;= 0</code>：当前上升，前一次下降或平坦，方向发生了变化</li>\n<li>如果 <code>currDiff &lt; 0</code> 且 <code>prevDiff &gt;= 0</code>：当前下降，前一次上升或平坦，方向发生了变化</li>\n<li>只在方向真正变化时才更新 <code>prevDiff</code>，这样可以自动跳过连续的平台期（相等元素）</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>动态规划解法（空间优化版）：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"function wiggleMaxLengthDP(nums: number[]): number {&#10;  let up = 1;&#10;  let down = 1;&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 1; i &lt; nums.length; i++) {&#10;    if (nums[i] &gt; nums[i - 1]) {&#10;      up = down + 1;&#10;    } else if (nums[i] &lt; nums[i - 1]) {&#10;      down = up + 1;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return Math.max(up, down);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> wiggleMaxLengthDP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> up </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> down </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      up </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> down </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nums[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nums[i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      down </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> up </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(up, down);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>DP 解法用 <code>up</code> 和 <code>down</code> 两个变量分别维护&quot;以上升结尾&quot;和&quot;以下降结尾&quot;的最长摆动序列长度。当遇到上升时，<code>up</code> 一定是在某个下降后面接一个上升，所以 <code>up = down + 1</code>。下降同理。</p>\n<p><strong>两种解法的等价性：</strong></p>\n<p>贪心解法统计拐点数量，DP 解法维护双状态转移。两者在逻辑上是等价的：贪心的每次 <code>count++</code> 对应 DP 中 <code>up</code> 或 <code>down</code> 增加 1。但贪心解法更直观，DP 解法更容易推广到其他变体问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>贪心</th>\n<th>DP（优化后）</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>单次遍历</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>常数变量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>本题展示了贪心与 DP 的微妙关系：很多贪心问题本质上是 DP 的特殊优化。当 DP 的状态转移只依赖于前一个状态，且最优选择具有贪心性质时，可以将 O(n) 空间的 DP 简化为 O(1) 的贪心。理解这一点有助于在面试中灵活选择解题策略。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 376 摆动序列","id":"leetcode-376-摆动序列"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 134 加油站","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-search-greedy/lc0134-gas-station"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 416 分割等和子集","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-dp/lc0416-partition-equal-subset-sum"}}